Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.87,0:05:16.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The guys don't know yet, do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.87,0:05:16.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}男生们还不知道吧
