Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.52,0:05:18.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊跟罗斯什么都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.21,0:05:20.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And Chandler still thinks Phoebe's pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.21,0:05:20.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钱德勒还以为是菲比怀孕了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.32,0:05:23.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's right. Chandler does still think I'm pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.32,0:05:23.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错  钱德勒还以为是我怀孕了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.17,0:05:27.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He hasn't asked me how I'm feeling or offered to carry my bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.17,0:05:27.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他没问我感觉如何 也没帮我提袋子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.99,0:05:30.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I feel bad for the woman who ends up with him.
