Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.03,0:05:35.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}After you, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.03,0:05:35.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是指在你之后的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.00,0:05:39.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't worry. I promise you only have to be pregnant for a few more hours
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.00,0:05:39.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别担心  你只需要再假装怀孕几小时
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.47,0:05:41.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...because I'm telling the father today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.47,0:05:41.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为今天我要告诉孩子他爸了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.15,0:05:42.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is it someone in the building?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.15,0:05:42.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他就住在这栋公寓吗
