Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.95,0:05:45.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是一楼那个高个子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.18,0:05:46.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.18,0:05:46.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}才不是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.00,0:05:48.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? I think he's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.00,0:05:48.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么  我觉得他很帅啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.47,0:05:50.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then you have his baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.47,0:05:50.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你可以去怀他的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.22,0:05:52.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Believe me, I'm trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.22,0:05:52.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}相信我  我正在努力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.42,0:05:56.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's so weird. You're gonna tell this guy today...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.42,0:05:56.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这种感觉真奇怪  你今天就要告诉这个男人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.78,0:05:59.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and he has no idea what's gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.78,0:05:59.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而他完全不知道会发生什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.56,0:06:01.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. You're just gonna knock on his door
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.56,0:06:01.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你马上就要敲开他的门
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.92,0:06:04.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and change his life forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.92,0:06:04.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}永远改变他的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.82,0:06:05.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're like Ed McMahon,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.82,0:06:05.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你就像艾德·麦马汉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.75,0:06:07.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}except without the big check.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.75,0:06:07.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只是手上没有拿大额支票
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.62,0:06:10.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or the raw sexual magnetism.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.62,0:06:10.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也缺乏原始的性吸引力
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.82,0:06:16.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, well, I guess it is pretty big news.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.82,0:06:16.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  这确实是个大消息
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.23,0:06:17.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pretty big? It's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.23,0:06:17.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大消息  这可是个天大的消息
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.93,0:06:19.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}God, this guy doesn't have a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.93,0:06:19.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  这个男人什么都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.60,0:06:21.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's just walking down the street thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.60,0:06:21.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他走在街上心想
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.13,0:06:24.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"I had sex with Rachel Greene. I rock!"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.13,0:06:24.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}"我跟瑞秋·格林做爱了  我太帅了"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.14,0:06:28.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then, bam! He's a father, everything's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.14,0:06:28.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后  砰  他突然当了爸爸  一切都变了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.67,0:06:30.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's only different if he wants it to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.67,0:06:30.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}除非他真的想当爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.69,0:06:32.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not gonna ask him for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.69,0:06:32.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不会对他提出任何要求
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.80,0:06:35.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, then. He still has this huge decision to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.80,0:06:35.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他还是得做出重大的决定
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.01,0:06:36.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now he's walking around thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.01,0:06:36.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在他边走边想
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.27,0:06:38.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Do I want to be a dad?" Then, bam!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.27,0:06:38.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}"我要当爸爸吗"  然后  砰
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.33,0:06:40.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What was that "bam"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.33,0:06:40.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这次怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.28,0:06:44.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know. He's hit by a bus, or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.28,0:06:44.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道  他可能是被公车撞了
