Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.13,0:07:31.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God, Pheebs! You're gonna have a baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.13,0:07:31.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  菲比 你要生孩子了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.90,0:07:36.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, I am. Oh, my God, I'm gonna have a baby!
