Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.82,0:07:41.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不认识他  那不重要
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.52,0:07:44.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He wants nothing to do with me or the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.52,0:07:44.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他不希望跟我或孩子扯上关系
