Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.89,0:08:15.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} No. Did you?  Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.89,0:08:15.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有  你呢  我找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.62,0:08:18.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's why I'm under the table, celebrating.
