Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.92,0:08:26.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is great. Those cameras were the only thing
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.92,0:08:26.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这下可好了  今天只有那些即可拍
