Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.04,0:08:32.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You guys just got married. Why is she so depressed?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.04,0:08:32.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们刚刚结婚  她为什么心情不好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.11,0:08:36.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All my energy is going into not asking that question.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.11,0:08:36.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我卯足了劲不去问她那个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.69,0:08:38.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't believe I screwed this up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.69,0:08:38.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不敢相信我给搞砸了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.67,0:08:40.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.67,0:08:40.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很遗憾  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.88,0:08:46.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here's a thought. This is the same ballroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.88,0:08:46.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有个点子  你们就是在这个宴会厅请的客
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.08,0:08:50.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's a band. There's gonna be plenty of dressedup people.
